. powerape dgp d2, focal(treat, binary p(0.5)) moderator(female, binary p(0.55)
> ) baseline(0.30) nodisplay

. powerape setaie d2, target(0.04) mainfocal(0.10) mainmoderator(0.05) nodispla
> y

. powerape power d2, n(4000) claim(detect) nsim(`NS') seed(207) engine(mata) no
> display

