. * D4: equivalence
. powerape dgp d4, focal(t, binary p(0.5)) baseline(0.30) nodisplay

. powerape setape d4, target(0) nodisplay

. powerape power d4, n(2000) claim(equivalence) sesoi(0.05) nsim(`NS') seed(211
