. * D7: empirical route on the shared pilot file (calibration is deterministic 
> here)
. import delimited data/pilot600.csv, clear varnames(1) asdouble
(encoding automatically selected: ISO-8859-2)
(3 vars, 600 obs)

. powerape dgp de, empirical focal(treat) covariates(age female) baseline(0.30)
>  signal(0.15) nodisplay

. powerape setape de, target(0.05) nodisplay

. mata: recr("D7 empirical beta0 (exact: same rows)", st_numscalar("r(beta0)"),
>  refd("D7", "beta0")[1], 1e-7)

